            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Grove Lake Girl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I absolutely love this recipe just the way it is! I know a lot of people like putting their own spin on recipes but give credit where credit is due, this is a great recipe. I use Stove Top stuffing for the breadcrumbs ONLY because I typically do not have seasoned breadcrumbs on hand but always have Stove Top.",
